Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183046\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 203/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5287/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.419      1 -total\n 55.94%    6.947      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 41.66%    5.174      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12949:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183046 and revision id 106160. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}